# M grabs a row, j and k carry it, Enter drops it and esc puts it back.
wait Export posts from the old CMS
press l
wait [Enter]read

press M
wait ◀ MOVING
wait [Enter]drop
frame grabbed
press j
wait /✓ Pick a theme[\s\S]*▶ .*Export posts from the old CMS/
frame carried-down
press enter
wait Item reordered
gone MOVING
frame dropped

press M
wait ◀ MOVING
press j
press esc
gone MOVING
wait /(?m)^.*✓ Pick a theme[\s\S]*Export posts from the old CMS/
frame put-back

press h
press M
wait /▶ Move the blog.* ◀ MOVING/
press j
wait /Replace the kitchen faucet[\s\S]*▶ Move the blog/
frame project-carried
press esc
gone MOVING
wait /Move the blog to plain files[\s\S]*Replace the kitchen faucet/

press q
exits
